# 🎬 Telugu Movie Sentiment Analysis using Naive Bayes

A complete NLP project that classifies Telugu movies as **HIT (positive)** or **FLOP (negative)**
using **tokenization**, **TF-IDF vectorization**, and a **Multinomial Naive Bayes** classifier.

## 📂 Project Structure



## ⚙️ Setup

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 2. Generate the dataset
python src/generate_dataset.py

# 3. Train the Naive Bayes model
python src/train_model.py

# 4. Test from the CLI
python src/predict.py Bahubali
python src/predict.py Radhe Shyam

# 5. Launch the Streamlit prompt-box UI
streamlit run app.py